WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
<v Marta>Welcome back to the garden show. Today we're planting tomatoes, and we'll talk about the right soil for them.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:31.000
<v Jonas>Thanks, Marta. The first thing I check is the weather. Tomatoes don't like a cold night, so I wait until late spring.

3
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:44.000
<v Marta>And how deep do you put the young plants? I always worry that the stem breaks when I press the soil down.

4
00:00:44.000 --> 00:01:02.000
<v Jonas>Deeper than you think. Bury two thirds of the stem &amp; the plant grows new roots along it.

5
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:07.000
<v Marta>That's all for this week. Next time we talk about water.
